# Node dependencies
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Production build artifacts
client/dist/
dist/
client/dist-demo/
dist-demo/

# Documentation screenshots may contain real customer or account details
